WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
[Phone ringing]

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:05.900
Thanks for

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.180
[Privacy beep]

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:09.560
I'm Liv, how can I help?

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:12.360
Hiya, I just wanted to ring in and book an appointment.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.520
Thanks, can you please tell me

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.720
if this is for you or someone else?

00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.560
It's for me, I'm new in the area,

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.920
I want to register with the dentist

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.520
and then get checked up as well.

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.200
Got it, are you looking for

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:30.080
a new patient check-up appointment?

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.000
Also, do you have a day or time that suits you best?

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.820
Ideally today, if we could do later on today,

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.240
that'd be great and yeah,

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:38.200
this would be a new patient check-up.

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.520
The first available appointment this afternoon

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:49.500
is at 2.30 or three in the afternoon or 3.30.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:50.960
Which one works for you?

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:52.200
Can we do three o'clock?

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:57.160
Thanks, may I have your full name

00:00:57.160 --> 00:00:59.560
and the best phone number to reach you on please?

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:01.600
Yeah, my name is Tristan Adams

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:04.600
and the best number to reach me on is this one.

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:07.050
[Contact detail privacy beep]

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.580
[Contact detail privacy beep]

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:18.380
Your new patient check-up appointment

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:21.240
is booked for Wednesday, the 7th of October

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.040
at 3pm.

00:01:23.040 --> 00:01:24.760
The team has all your details

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:26.400
and looks forward to seeing you then.

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.060
Is there anything else I can help with?

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.500
No, that would be all. Thank you. Bye-bye.
